# OmniRoute — Overview

## What is OmniRoute?
Self-hosted AI Gateway that unifies all model providers behind one OpenAI-compatible `/v1` surface on port `20128`.

## Key Features
- Auto-Combo routing (model: "auto")
- Circuit breakers, key policies, observability
- Per-provider account management (opencode-go, opencode-zen, antigravity, etc.)
- MCP server (22 Obsidian tools, memory, skills, etc.)
- Dashboard + cost/quota tracking

## Ports
- 20128 — Dashboard + API
- 20129 — API (separate)
- 20132 — Live WebSocket

## Auth
- REQUIRE_API_KEY=true → inference needs API key
- Dashboard login via INITIAL_PASSWORD
